Geant4 version 11.3.0 built with built-in CLHEP (based on version 2.4.7.1).
on system macOS 15.1.1 Sequoia, arm64 64-bit architecture,
compiler LLVM/clang-16 (Apple clang version 16.0.0, clang-1600.0.26.4).
 
===== System details ======
Darwin Kernel Version 24.1.0: Thu Oct 10 21:03:15 PDT 2024; arm64
 
====== Main build settings enabled ======
GEANT4_USE_OPENGL_X11
GEANT4_USE_RAYTRACER_X11

====== To build an example with this version ======
CMake - scripts for setting up the system are available in:
  bin/
GNUMake - scripts for configuring the environment are installed in:
  share/Geant4/geant4make/

NOTE: NO data sets are provided in this binary installation.
      Therefore, you need to explicitely install them by downloading the
      archives of the data from the Geant4 download page and unpack inside:
        share/Geant4/data/
      You may get run-time errors or configuration errors otherwise.

See the Installation Manual for all details !
